Zimperium® is an industry leader in enterprise mobile security, being the first and only company to provide a complete mobile threat defense system.  Cybercriminals are taking a mobile-first attack strategy, making mobile devices and applications primary targets for phishing, malware, and zero-day threats. Traditional security isn’t enough—organizations need dedicated protection. Zimperium provides industry-leading, AI-driven security to proactively defend against evolving mobile threats. 
 &nbsp; 
  As part of our fast - growing pace, we are currently   seeking a high-energy, self-motivated   Enterprise Account Executive   to drive revenue in assigned territory through new logo and upsell/cross sell opportunities. The position is the territory owner responsible for working with internal support (Customer Success, Marketing, Channel, etc.) to build relationships and maximize sales&nbsp;  solutions to both development and operational problems.  
 &nbsp; 
  Location:   Germany preferred

Please read the required qualifications carefully and note that full business-level fluency in German &amp; English is a requirement.  
 &nbsp; 
  Your role  
 The industry is referring to a "war for talent". There has never been a time when the right people were more in demand and more valuable than it is today. We are truly in the people economy, which means that recruitment is not only crucial but also a significant competitive advantage. To lead this change, we rethought recruitment. 
 &nbsp; 
 As a working student, you will be a part of the creative and high-performing Talent Search (TS) Team, one of three core processes of Netlight. Your main responsibility will be around  active sourcing, application management, recruitment , and other processes related to the growth of Netlight. You will get insights into the whole recruitment process, from the first contact to a world-class onboarding of our new colleagues into Netlight. 
 &nbsp; 
